{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMEhvbWVzbWFuJTIwJTI4MjAxNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Homesman","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eGpuOhkm1wG2AxEJShazH5NVGAO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dXLs7RiKzFlD1clG4PrRYxN3g68.jpg","description":"When three women living on the edge of the American frontier are driven mad by harsh pioneer life, the task of saving them falls to the pious, independent-minded Mary Bee Cuddy. Transporting the women by covered wagon to Iowa, she soon realizes just how daunting the journey will be, and employs a low-life drifter, George Briggs, to join her. The unlikely pair and the three women head east, where a waiting minister and his wife have offered to take the women in. But the group first must traverse the harsh Nebraska Territories marked by stark beauty, psychological peril and constant threat.\n\nRated R · Released 18 May 2014 · United States of America, France · Language: English · 122 min\nStudio: The Javelina Film Company, EuropaCorp, Ithaca Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Western","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"122 min","cast":["Hilary Swank","Tommy Lee Jones","Grace Gummer","Miranda Otto","Sonja Richter","Tim Blake Nelson","James Spader","John Lithgow"],"director":["Tommy Lee Jones"],"released":"2014-05-18T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tommy Lee Jones","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mCiZNRAzbnPojJEZwVZWLw9kzxR.jpg"},{"name":"Hilary Swank","character":"Mary Bee Cuddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uin6aAehUGpPCiJCaSjZG8B7M7d.jpg"},{"name":"Tommy Lee Jones","character":"George Briggs","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mCiZNRAzbnPojJEZwVZWLw9kzxR.jpg"},{"name":"Grace Gummer","character":"Arabella Sours","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z9MiGb1QdivKRYCgxcbcPALOkI4.jpg"},{"name":"Miranda Otto","char